=== HOW IT WORKS ===

Week 16 Ends (Monday night):
- GitHub Action detects Week 16 games complete
- Automatically initializes Week 17 Semifinals
- Creates playoff rounds, standings, and picks for top 4 seeds
- Unlock schedule starts Tuesday 9am

Week 17 (Semifinals):
- Top 4 seeds pick via snake draft (1-1-2-3-4-1-2-3-4)
- Picks unlock every 3 hours (sleep mode 8pm-9am)
- 5th+ place picks normally on /picks page (4 picks, no restrictions)

Week 17 Ends (Monday night):
- GitHub Action detects Week 17 games complete
- Calculates final Week 17 scores
- Marks semifinal round as complete
- Automatically initializes Week 18 Championship (top 2) and Consolation (3rd/4th)

Week 18 (Championship & Consolation):
- Championship: Top 2 compete via snake draft (1-2-1-2-1-2-1-2)
- Consolation: 3rd/4th place battle (4 picks, no restrictions)
- 5th+ place picks normally (combined Week 17+18 for final placement)

Week 18 Ends (Monday night):
- GitHub Action detects Week 18 games complete
- Calculates final championship scores
- Marks all playoff rounds as complete
- Season done!

